{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the world through the eyes of a bonkers bum who stumbled upon a strange artifact and start your journey between our world and its bright, insane, but yet disturbingly familiar reflection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No princesses to save, no honor or glory \u2013 this is not your story. You'll have to survive, explore dangerous streets, and find your way through chaos on your own strange way to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/extras/f86532dd98a32216f7d02d180fc29c75.poster.avif?t=1763825607\" width=1170 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/extras/f86532dd98a32216f7d02d180fc29c75.webm?t=1763825607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/extras/f86532dd98a32216f7d02d180fc29c75.mp4?t=1763825607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bonkers Bum</i> is an adventure stealth-action game with a semi-open world, where your choices and survival skills determine the outcome. Explore a psychedelic universe, switch between worlds, and use safe zones to eat, rest, and craft everything you need for ongoing missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between worlds and use street-smart logic to defeat enemies, avoid traps and unpredictable challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft useful items and weapons using resources from both worlds and collect unique treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a vibrant comic-book-style world with absurd humor and a nostalgic '90s vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can survive alone or make new friends and travel with a little companion by your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the environment and uncover hidden secrets in familiar streets and their acid-bright reflections.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/extras/e083ae826b03fb5756b39860e7bf8ccf.avif?t=1763825607\" width=1438 height=810 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4114320?t=1763825607","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/87e5b8e571e4c9ea347ffda87cb92a9e0c98506a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763825607","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/e6489adfd6199101d26e986fb96dcbe8b4e8ca19/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763825607","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114320/e6489adfd6199101d26e986fb96dcbe8b4e8ca19/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763825607","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See the 